ur comprehensive features.<br><br>Explore the world through realistic visual maps with our Earth Map app, featuring GPS satellite map views and various map types such as night mode, terrain, normal view, and real-time traffic alerts. Our route planner app includes satellite maps of renowned tourist destinations and famous landmarks. Discover satellite images of world-famous places, explore GPS-tagged buildings and cities with a single tap, and effortlessly plan your global adventures with the Earth satellite map. Easily find your favorite destinations by searching their names and with detailed street experience with the added feature of a GPS speedometer.<br><br>Utilize the speedometer feature to accurately track your vehicle speed or monitor your speed during activities such as cycling, running, flying, or sailing. The GPS speedometer displays speed in Km/h units, providing real-time speed information. Additionally, set a speed limit to receive alarms for overspeeding, enhancing safety through the GPS speedometer functionality.<br><br>Experience the convenience of our GPS area calculator, enabling you to effortlessly calculate distances between multiple points. Simply click on various locations on the map to obtain distance measurements in both kilometers and meters through the GPS distance measure feature. Whether you&#39;re navigating locally or exploring global destinations, enjoy easy access to driving directions and the versatile area calculator for seamless travel planning.<br><br>The satellite Earth Maps GPS navigation app enhances your navigation experience by providing a precise angle of inclination at your GPS location. Measure both vertical and horizontal levels in your vicinity within seconds. For optimal results, simply place the device on a stable surface and lock the orientation. Get the most accurate readings for a comprehensive understanding of your surroundings.",
